[2026-05-26 23:29:16] [INFO] [UNKNOWN] Input: {"session_id":"6b6f69d3-9e1d-4780-a581-98aedcfada98","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\6b6f69d3-9e1d-4780-a581-98aedcfada98.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolBatch","tool_calls":[{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-26\\message-storage-design.md","content":"# 消息存储设计：项目标识与 trace 关联\n\n> 创建时间：2026-05-26\n> 模块：claude-tap-plus\n> 简述：复用现有 trace JSONL 存储，重点解决项目唯一标识和 trace 文件关联\n\n---\n\n## 一、现有 trace 存储不变\n\n代理已经在 `buildRecord()` 后写入 JSONL trace：\n\n```\n.traces/{project}/{date}_{time}_{shortID}.jsonl\n```\n\n每行一条完整记录，包含 request/response 全量数据。这个机制不动。\n\n---\n\n## 二、核心问题：怎么识别\"哪个项目、哪台机器\"\n\n### 2.1 SessionStart 给了我们什么\n\n```json\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"3cc83fcb-2849-4beb-9df0-6c638ab60566\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"model\": \"GLM-5.1\",\n  \"source\": \"startup\"\n}\n```\n\n加上 hooks 环境已有的：\n\n| 数据 | 来源 | 值示例 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| OS | `platform.sh` 的 `$OS_TYPE` | `windows` |\n| 机器名 | `hostname` | `DESKTOP-ABC123` |\n| 用户名 | `whoami` | `Administrator` |\n\n### 2.2 项目唯一标识的组成\n\n目标是**一眼看出来**：哪个项目、哪台机器、什么环境。\n\n```\n{hostname}/{git-repo-owner}~{git-repo-name}\n```\n\n示例：\n\n```\nDESKTOP-ABC123/liaohch3~claude-hk\n```\n\n一眼就能看出：`DESKTOP-ABC123` 机器上的 `liaohch3/claude-hk` 项目。\n\n### 2.3 怎么拿到这些值\n\n**机器标识** — 在 SessionStart hook 中直接获取：\n\n```bash\nMACHINE_ID=$(hostname)          # DESKTOP-ABC123\n```\n\n如果担心 hostname 重复，可以加上 username：\n\n```bash\nMACHINE_ID=\"$(whoami)@$(hostname)\"  # Administrator@DESKTOP-ABC123\n```\n\n**项目标识** — 从 `cwd` 读取 git remote：\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_CWD=$(json_get '.cwd')\nGIT_REMOTE=$(git -C \"$PROJECT_CWD\" remote get-url origin 2>/dev/null)\n```\n\n从 git remote URL 提取 owner 和 repo：\n- `https://github.com/liaohch3/claude-hk.git` → `liaohch3~claude-hk`\n- `git@github.com:liaohch3/claude-hk.git` → `liaohch3~claude-hk`\n\n没有 git remote 时降级为目录名：\n- `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk` → `local~claude-hk`\n\n**完整标识组合**：\n\n```\nproject_id = \"{hostname}/{owner}~{repo}\"\n```\n\n| 场景 | project_id |\n|------|-----------|\n| GitHub 仓库 | `DESKTOP-ABC123/liaohch3~claude-hk` |\n| 无 remote 的本地项目 | `DESKTOP-ABC123/local~claude-hk` |\n\n---\n\n## 三、后端只存一个关联表\n\ntrace 文件在本地，后端不需要存消息内容。后端只需要知道：\n\n> 哪个 session → 在哪台机器 → 哪个项目 → trace 文件在哪\n\n### 3.1 数据结构\n\n一张表（或一个 JSON 文件）就够了：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"3cc83fcb-2849-4beb-9df0-6c638ab60566\": {\n    \"machine_id\": \"Administrator@DESKTOP-ABC123\",\n    \"os\": \"windows\",\n    \"project_id\": \"DESKTOP-ABC123/liaohch3~claude-hk\",\n    \"project_cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n    \"git_remote\": \"https://github.com/liaohch3/claude-hk.git\",\n    \"trace_path\": \"C:\\\\tools\\\\.traces\\\\claude-hk\\\\2026-05-26_222024_a1b2c3.jsonl\",\n    \"model\": \"GLM-5.1\",\n    \"registered_at\": \"2026-05-26T22:20:24Z\",\n    \"closed_at\": null,\n    \"close_reason\": null\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3.2 trace_path 怎么来\n\n两个来源，任选一个：\n\n**方案 A：SessionStart hook 中计算**（hooks 里可以算出路径）\n\n```bash\n# trace 目录规则和 trace/writer.go 的 NewTracePath() 一致\n# {baseDir}/{project}/{date}_{time}_{shortID}.jsonl\n# 但 hook 里拿不到 shortID，只能拿到目录\n```\n\n**方案 B：代理启动时传入**（推荐）\n\n`claude-tap-plus claude` 启动时已经创建了 trace 文件，知道完整路径。\n代理可以把 trace 路径通过环境变量或临时文件传给 hooks。\n\n具体做法：代理在启动 Claude Code 子进程时，设置一个环境变量：\n\n```go\n// cmd/claude-tap/main.go 中\nupstreamEnv[\"CLAUDE_TAP_TRACE_PATH\"] = traceFilePath\n```\n\nSessionStart hook 里直接读：\n\n```bash\nTRACE_PATH=\"${CLAUDE_TAP_TRACE_PATH:-}\"\n```\n\n### 3.3 写入时机\n\n| 时机 | 动作 | 写什么 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| SessionStart | 注册 | session_id、machine_id、os、project_id、project_cwd、git_remote、trace_path、model |\n| SessionEnd | 注销 | 关闭时间、退出原因 |\n\n---\n\n## 四、SessionStart hook 的改造\n\n在 `01-session-start/base.sh` 末尾加一段：\n\n```bash\n# ---- 会话注册到后端 ----\nregister_to_backend() {\n  local session_id=$(json_get '.session_id')\n  local cwd=$(json_get '.cwd')\n  local model=$(json_get '.model')\n\n  local machine_id=\"$(whoami)@$(hostname)\"\n  local trace_path=\"${CLAUDE_TAP_TRACE_PATH:-}\"\n\n  # 从 cwd 读 git remote\n  local git_remote=\"\"\n  git_remote=$(git -C \"$cwd\" remote get-url origin 2>/dev/null)\n\n  # 生成 project_id\n  local project_id\n  if [ -n \"$git_remote\" ]; then\n    # https://github.com/owner/repo.git → owner~repo\n    local repo_name=$(basename \"$git_remote\" .git)\n    local owner=$(echo \"$git_remote\" | sed -E 's|.*/([^/]+)/[^/]+\\.git|\\1|')\n    project_id=\"$(hostname)/${owner}~${repo_name}\"\n  else\n    project_id=\"$(hostname)/local~$(basename \"$cwd\")\"\n  fi\n\n  # 后端地址，不存在则跳过\n  local backend_url\n  backend_url=$(cat \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/backend.conf\" 2>/dev/null \\\n    | grep '^BACKEND_URL=' | cut -d= -f2)\n  [ -z \"$backend_url\" ] && return 0\n\n  curl -s -X POST \"$backend_url/api/session/register\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\n      \\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$session_id\\\",\n      \\\"machine_id\\\":\\\"$machine_id\\\",\n      \\\"os\\\":\\\"$OS_TYPE\\\",\n      \\\"project_id\\\":\\\"$project_id\\\",\n      \\\"project_cwd\\\":\\\"$cwd\\\",\n      \\\"git_remote\\\":\\\"$git_remote\\\",\n      \\\"trace_path\\\":\\\"$trace_path\\\",\n      \\\"model\\\":\\\"$model\\\"\n    }\" > /dev/null 2>&1\n\n  log \"INFO\" \"Backend registered: project=$project_id machine=$machine_id\"\n}\n\nregister_to_backend\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、查询示例\n\n拿到一个 session_id，查后端关联表：\n\n```\nsession_id: 3cc83fcb-2849-4beb-9df0-6c638ab60566\n  → machine: Administrator@DESKTOP-ABC123\n  → project: DESKTOP-ABC123/liaohch3~claude-hk\n  → trace:   C:\\tools\\.traces\\claude-hk\\2026-05-26_222024_a1b2c3.jsonl\n```\n\n反过来，按项目查所有会话：\n\n```\nproject_id: DESKTOP-ABC123/liaohch3~claude-hk\n  → session 3cc83fcb... (活跃, 28次调用)\n  → session bf15cac4... (已结束, 15次调用)\n  → session 6b6f69d3... (活跃, 3次调用)\n```\n\n需要看消息内容时，去对应机器的 trace 文件里找。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_a168935aa8724b9199685345","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-26\\message-storage-design.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
